{
  "name": "05a - Adapter: Digest Delivery",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "ca228a60-c630-40c9-aab7-666e4f300f72",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -420,
        -140
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 05a - Adapter: Digest Delivery\nCalled by **05 - KPI Watchdog** via Execute Workflow once a digest is generated.\n\n**Adapter pattern:** this sub-workflow is the single place a digest gets *delivered*. Today it writes to the `kpi_digests` Data Table (so the portfolio demo has zero external dependencies). To ship to a real channel, swap the **Deliver: Data Table** node below for a Slack node (`postMessage` to #kpi-alerts) or a Send Email node - the input shape (`run_timestamp`, `digest_text`, `anomaly_count`, `source_down_count`, `metrics_json`) does not change.\n\n**Test hook:** pass `force_crash: true` in the trigger input to prove this sub-workflow reaches `[CORE] Error Handler` independently of its parent - errors here should never depend on the parent also failing.",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 480,
        "color": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "1f96b4e2-320f-4f3f-9ff8-28a73a8fcbe8",
      "name": "Execute Workflow Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflowTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        -420,
        240
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "workflowInputs": {
          "values": [
            {
              "name": "run_timestamp"
            },
            {
              "name": "digest_text"
            },
            {
              "name": "anomaly_count"
            },
            {
              "name": "source_down_count"
            },
            {
              "name": "metrics_json"
            },
            {
              "name": "force_crash"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "4bff9035-4e4c-428f-b691-4bed6c3b7777",
      "name": "Force Crash Test?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        -280,
        240
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.force_crash === true }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "de02b16f-056c-46c5-9577-56cf949056f3",
      "name": "Throw Forced Failure (05a)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -140,
        120
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "throw new Error('05a Adapter: forced failure test (force_crash input) - proving this sub-workflow errors independently of its parent and reaches [CORE] Error Handler on its own.');"
      }
    },
